msgid ""
"Perhaps you’ve just updated your template, and the update broke your "
"template. Or perhaps you’ve made a terrible mistake, like accidentally "
"confirming the installation of an unsigned package that could be malicious. "
"If you want to undo changes to a template, there are three basic methods:"
